# Optional: override the satellite imagery provider (default: Esri World Imagery, no key).
# NOTE: anything in a VITE_ variable is shipped to the browser. Only put a public,
# domain-restricted tile key here (e.g. MapTiler/Mapbox), never a private secret.
# VITE_SATELLITE_TILE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/tiles/satellite-v2/{z}/{x}/{y}.jpg?key=YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY
# VITE_SATELLITE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; MapTiler &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors
